// Spell
@1 = ~Summon Black Mantidrake~
@2 = ~Summon Black Mantidrake
(Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 5
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: 1 round/level
Casting Time: 5
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell summons a black mantidrake, a skull-faced manticore of the black dragon's brood, to fight for the wizard. It obeys the caster until the spell ends or it is slain.

Black mantidrake: HP 55, AC 3, THAC0 12, 2 claw attacks per round (1d8+1 slashing damage, +1 weapon). As long as no enemy is within reach of its claws, it throws a corrosive tail spike at each enemy it sees within 30 ft. (up to ten), at most once every 2 rounds; each spike deals 1d6 missile damage and 2d4 acid damage (save vs. Breath for half). Allies are not hit. It is immune to acid and moves freely through Entangle and Web.~

// Creature and its volley
@3 = ~Black Mantidrake~
@4 = ~Corrosive Spikes~
